<?xml version="1.0"?>
<fmxmlsnippet type="FMObjectList">
  <Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)">
    <Text>PURPOSE: Action-routed UI switchboard for the repointed Invoices layout (anchor I__INVOICES). Every button and trigger on the layout binds here with an "action" param. Owns ONLY front-end concerns — found sets, current-record field toggles, dialogs, windows, popovers, object jumps. All data work delegates to headless workers.</Text>
  </Step>
  <Step enable="False" id="61" name="Insert Text">
    <SelectAll state="False"/>
    <Text>PARAMS (JSON): action (required) + per-action keys.&#xD;&#xD;VERBS:&#xD;  init            — OnLayoutEnter: SETTINGS__EnsureLoaded, then find + list refresh&#xD;  load            — re-run find + list refresh from current settings&#xD;  filter          — optional tip; persists invoices.currentType, then find + list refresh&#xD;  toggleType      — toggle StatusDokumenta Račun/Predračun on current record + receipt number + list refresh&#xD;  togglePayment   — cycle NacinPlacanja Gotovina → Virman → Kartica&#xD;  changeCompany   — toggle invoices.currentCompany OD/DOO, then find + list refresh&#xD;  recalcList      — list refresh only (INV__LoadLastInvoices worker)&#xD;  regeneratePDF   — delegate to Process Invoice (UI), operation=regeneratePDF&#xD;  refund          — delegate to Process Invoice (UI), operation=refund (dialog lives there)&#xD;  printOptions    — open Card Invoice Print card window&#xD;  pickClient      — open Card Odabir Klijenta card window&#xD;  setPaymentDate  — validate Globals::DatumPlacanja, write DatumPlacanja, close popover&#xD;  removeProforma  — clear PDFFile (unlocks), jump to generateProforma object&#xD;  proformaPopover — optional tip; set Globals::SelectedInvoiceType, list refresh, jump by fiscal state&#xD;&#xD;RETURNS: Response_Finalize envelope. Worker errors are absorbed via Response_Absorb.&#xD;&#xD;CONTEXT: must run on a layout anchored on I__INVOICES (record-bound verbs read the current record).&#xD;&#xD;Example button binding&#xD;Perform Script [ Specified: From list ; “I__InvoicesDispatcher” ; Parameter: JSONSetElement ( "{}" ; "action" ; "toggleType" ; JSONString ) ]</Text>
    <Field>$README</Field>
  </Step>
